## Clean-room rebuild attributions

Several packages in core/ are clean-room reimplementations of algorithms
originally published in copyleft-licensed projects. Each carries provenance
documentation in its TECHNICAL.md. No source code was viewed during
implementation; only published algorithm descriptions in papers, textbooks,
and open documentation.

Inspirations gratefully acknowledged:
- core/argument-graph — Toulmin model; Argdown public documentation
- core/corpus — Manning, Raghavan, Schütze, "Introduction to Information Retrieval"
- core/mind-map — Fruchterman-Reingold, Kamada-Kawai force-directed layout papers
